"(mikrofon mati; klik mikrofon untuk membatalkan)"

#: data/voice-typing@anduinos.com/extension.js:84
#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Measuring recognition performance: %d seconds remaining (microphone off; "
"click the microphone to cancel)"
msgstr ""
"Mengukur kinerja pengenalan: %d detik tersisa (mikrofon mati; klik mikrofon "
"untuk membatalkan)"

#: data/voice-typing@anduinos.com/extension.js:88
